WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.947
- [Zac] In 1983, the girl known as Eleven

00:00:01.947 --> 00:00:03.900
opened the gates to the Upside Down.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.360
While this led to the temporary
disappearance of Will Byers

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:07.720
and the death of Barbara Holland,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.370
the most dangerous and impactful thing

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.550
that opening the gate did
was allow the Mind Flayer

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.140
to access the human world.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.240
The Mind Flayer takes on an abstract form,

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.370
often described as a shadow or a storm,

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.680
even being referred to
as the shadow monster,

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.490
like many characters
from "Stranger Things"

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.280
it's most likely exists as an allegory

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.410
for the communist leadership

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.030
that existed in Russia at the time.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.350
And we'll get into how its
behavior reflects that.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:29.400
When the Mind Flayer enters

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.990
the Right Side Up world of Hawkins,

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.750
it may be the biggest threat that the town

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.940
has ever encountered.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.432
LUCAS: We're talking about
the destruction of our world

00:00:36.432 --> 00:00:37.500
as we know it

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:38.980
- To learn more about the Mind Flayer

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.670
and its connections to the
ideology of the Soviet Union,

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:43.855
stick around to the end of this video.

00:00:43.855 --> 00:00:47.188
(dramatic upbeat music)

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.930
Welcome to "Horror History."

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:53.330
The Mind Flayer did not
initially or at least directly

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.670
affect the town of Hawkins Indiana in 1983

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.720
when the gates of the Upside
Down was first opened,

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.930
however roughly a year later, Will Byers

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:01.520
sees the Mind Flayer for the first time,

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.420
indicating its arrival to Hawkins.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.200
Like the Demogorgon,
the Mind Flayer's name

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.620
originates from the manual
of the boys' favorite game,

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.750
Dungeons and Dragons.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.160
This shadow monster
demonstrates many of the traits

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.770
explained in the D&amp;D manual,

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:14.740
especially a tendency
towards a mind control

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.180
and being linked to its victims.

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.330
That all starts with Will.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:19.460
So to fully understand
why the creature chose him

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.460
as its first victim,

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:22.020
I'm gonna have to take it all the way back

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:24.333
to Will's first visit to the Upside Down.

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:27.666
(dramatic upbeat music)

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:30.790
It is likely that Will Byers

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:32.480
becomes the Mind Flayer's first target

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:35.020
because Will was the first
person to go into the Upside Down

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:36.160
and come out alive.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:37.350
This means that the Mind Flayer

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.580
could have already had
some familiarity with him.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.700
I assume that it already
started infecting Will

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.130
in the Upside Down in November of 1983.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:46.480
When he's found he has a
tentacle suctioned to his mouth

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.000
that they have to carefully remove.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.130
The tentacle is not attached
to anything specific,

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.930
it's just kind of part of the Upside Down.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:53.040
We've seen the Mind Flayer

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.040
or as I sometimes like
to call it to the MF,

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.830
take control of nearly every organism

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:57.680
found in these tunnels.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:01:59.800
So it stands to reason
that it was already making

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.420
some sort of infection into Will.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.620
Over Christmas that year
Will coughs up a slug

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:04.453
into a sink drain.

00:02:04.453 --> 00:02:06.100
That later becomes a Demadog.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.770
I did an episode of "Horror
History" on a Demodog as well.

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:09.790
Since the Mind Flayer

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:11.410
is essentially the leader of the Demodogs,

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.360
this means that it was
in fact the Mind Flayer

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.670
that made contact with Will in 1983.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:18.100
On the night of October 28th, 1984

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.410
Will is enjoying playing at
the Arcade with his friends

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:21.790
when he's suddenly given a vision

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:23.360
that he's back in the Upside Down.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:25.510
It's here that will actually sees the MF

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:28.300
for the first time partially
obscured by a dark cloud

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.120
filled with flashes of orange lightning.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.510
Even though the Mind Flayer
hasn't technically flayed

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.330
or taken over it Will
yet, its connection to him

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:37.033
allows it to communicate its
intentions without words.

00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:39.030
(upbeat music)

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.350
DR OWENS: What do you
think the evil wanted?

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.360
WILL: To kill you.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.371
DR OWENS: To kill you?

00:02:43.371 --> 00:02:44.204
WILL: Not me,

00:02:44.204 --> 00:02:47.202
(suspenseful music)

00:02:47.202 --> 00:02:48.360
everyone else.

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:51.450
- However, Will is only a small
part of the Mind Flares plan

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:52.820
to infiltrate Hawkins.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:54.020
Dustin Henderson discovers

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.020
a new form of Demogorgon
which he coins as a Demodog.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:59.470
The Mind Flayer's influence
over these creatures and Will

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.160
represents what's known as a hive mind

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.640
or a collective consciousness.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.570
As a result any information that Will

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:05.620
or the Demodogs learn,

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.210
the Mind Flayer will know as well.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:10.030
This is an analogy to
what went on in the USSR.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.310
In my episode on Alexi,

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.130
I talked about how there
was constant surveillance

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.090
in the Soviet union

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:15.610
and its citizens were being monitored

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.780
to make sure they were
upholding communist ideals.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.020
In the same way, the Mind
Flayer taps into the minds

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.670
of those who chooses to take control of

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:23.420
and keeps them under constant surveillance

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.720
which goes a long way to
helping it stay in power.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.080
The Mind Flayer makes the Demodogs

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.700
dig a tunnel system under Hawkins.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.360
The citizens are left completely unaware

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.710
of the Mind Flayers' existence
apart from a few farmers

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.150
who have land above the tunnel route

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.800
who noticed their pumpkins rot and die,

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.680
creating a lot of hostility between them.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.970
The Mind Flayer continues
to reveal itself to Will

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.700
each time more vivid and more
aggressive than the last.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.290
Will, an avid artist draws
what he sees in his visions

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:47.690
including a spider like
system of funnel clouds.

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.200
Then on Halloween, Will
opens up to his best friend,

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.777
Mike Wheeler about what he's seeing.

00:03:51.777 --> 00:03:54.413
(upbeat music)

00:03:54.413 --> 00:03:59.404
- No. It was like this
huge shadow in the sky.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:06.163
Only it was alive.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:09.760
It was coming for me

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.000
- The next day after school,

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.420
Will is again sent into a
vision of the Upside Down

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.290
as the Mind Flayer chases after him.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.340
This time, even more
aggressively than before

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.673
resulting in this happening.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.230
Will later explains
what happened to his mom

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.620
and describes the Mind Flayer

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.252
as more of a feeling.

00:04:28.252 --> 00:04:30.795
WILL: I felt it everywhere.

00:04:30.795 --> 00:04:32.350
I still feel it.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:34.000
- The next day, he stays home from school

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.210
and appears to be sick.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.450
But instead of running a fever

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:38.530
his temperature is extremely low.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:41.280
This is a major trait of the
Mind Flayer who likes the cold

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.830
and wants to keep its human
host as chilly as possible.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:45.650
This is probably another
part of the allegory

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.300
of the Mind Flayer being representative

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.840
of the Soviet Union and
Russia and the greater region

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:51.700
that the USSR had control over.

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:54.210
The climate in that part of the
world is absolutely freezing

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.880
by my sunny SoCal standards.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:58.320
So it's very telling that the
creature feels most at home

00:04:58.320 --> 00:04:59.730
when temperatures are low.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.210
Will very bluntly
explains this when his mom

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.660
tries to draw him a bath.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.713
WILL: No.

00:05:04.713 --> 00:05:05.800
JOYCE: What?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.020
WILL: He likes it cold

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:09.230
- Much like citizens under the USSR,

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.590
Will's individual
personality is being stifled

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:14.090
or hidden away under the Mind
Flayer's own personality.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.470
Think of Will like a citizen

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:17.290
serving under his communist leader.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.480
As Hopper and Mike come over
to the Byers house to help,

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.340
Will does his best to convey
what the MF is doing to him.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.570
He describes sharing the
same thoughts and feelings

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:26.560
referring to them as his now memories.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:29.190
They feel like memories, but
they take place in the present

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:30.870
rather than the past.

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:34.222
WILL: It's like he's reaching
into Hawkins more and more.

00:05:34.222 --> 00:05:37.717
And the more he spreads the
more connected to him I feel.

00:05:37.717 --> 00:05:40.270
- The mind Flayer would soon
face its first major threat

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.450
when Chief Hopper digs his
way into one of the veins

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:45.775
of the underground tunnel system
and catches a big surprise.

00:05:45.775 --> 00:05:49.108
(dramatic upbeat music)

00:05:50.686 --> 00:05:53.103
(slow music)

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:56.650
- [Zac] When Hopper infiltrates
the underground tunnels

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:58.910
one of the vines growing their sprays him.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:05:59.743
"IN THE FACE"

00:05:59.743 --> 00:06:02.040
- Causing him to collapse
and become vulnerable.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.250
You know, I've used that clip before,

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:05.120
but I don't think it's
ever been more relevant.

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.470
However, the Mind Flayer
doesn't seek to flay Hopper

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.710
the way that it's Flayed Will.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:11.600
Instead, as Will promised,
it just wants to kill him.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.210
As Will and the others work to save him,

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.600
The Mind Flayer has another
set of issues to contend with.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.870
Scientists at the Hawkins lab

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.730
conduct a test with the
soil that they collected

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.370
from the areas with rotting pumpkins.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:22.200
They light a burner
under the infected soil

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:23.410
and causing a mini storm

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.800
similar to the one that Will
first saw the Mind Flayer in,

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.780
but this time on a much smaller scale.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:30.620
This is another example of
the MF reacting negatively

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.590
to the heat, as MFs often do.

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:35.320
At the exact same time, we
see yet another example,

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.180
when a group of soldiers
burn off the tunnels

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.140
with a flame thrower.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.490
Will's connection to the Mind Flayer

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.600
causes him to ride around in pain as well.

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.130
There's probably no image
in all of "Stranger Things"

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.352
that's more disturbing.

00:06:45.352 --> 00:06:48.102
(will screaming)

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:51.100
After Will is rushed to the Hawkins lab,

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:53.060
he's sedated and that the pain subsides.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:54.140
The Mind Flayer demonstrates

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.000
that Will no longer has much agency

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.260
when he barely recognizes
the people that he knows.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.530
In other words, the Mind Flayer

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:01.240
is almost completely in control.

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.700
It makes Will tell the scientists

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.010
that the only way to stop it
is to send all the soldiers

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:07.110
to one specific place in
the underground tunnels.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.810
But really it's just setting
up a huge trap to get revenge

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:11.350
on the soldiers that
brought it so much pain

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:12.500
with their flame throwers.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:13.350
After this happens,

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:15.620
Mike realizes that Will
is essentially a spy

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.540
for the Mind Flayer.

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.360
The idea of a Russian spy
posing as an American citizen,

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.340
gives us another real world parallel.

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.230
The KGB was a Soviet security

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.080
and foreign intelligence agency in place

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.260
between the 1950s and the 1990s,

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:29.750
who controversially operated
as a secret police unit

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:30.750
in the Soviet Union.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.170
They also sent spies to
integrate in other countries

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:35.000
like the United States to get information

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.390
on those who may oppose
their communist ideology.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.720
So if the Flayer Will represents the KGB

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:42.290
then I guess Mike
represents the American CIA

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.290
because he figures out
that if they sedate Will,

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.700
it'll keep the Mind Flayer
from being able to spy on them.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.980
This is basically like
unplugging the webcam.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.560
The Mind Flayer could no
longer see into their lives.

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.960
So the gang is able to escape the lab.

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:55.200
Well, most of them.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.033
When Will comes to,

00:07:56.033 --> 00:07:58.290
he finds himself in
another unfamiliar location

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.770
because he does not know where he is,

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.090
neither does the Mind Flayer.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:03.380
That is until Will hears
the Byers' phone ring

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.140
and realizes he's close to home.

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.340
Before the Mind Flayer can
send any monsters their way,

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:09.640
he's once again sedated and relocated.

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:12.100
When Will and effectively
the Mind Flayer inside of him

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:14.220
wake up they're being
blasted with heat lamps.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.120
For the first time
Will's appearance changes

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.240
and his face and body are
covered with a blue veins

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.160
which kind of looks similar

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.860
to what the underground tunnels look like.

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:23.480
As Nancy jabs a hot fire
poker into Will's side

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.520
because, yes Nancy is
the type of girl to stab

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:27.550
at 1000 degree fire poker
into her boyfriend's

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:29.360
13-year-old brother in a moment of panic.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.130
The Mind Flayer comes shooting out of Will

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.720
faster than a Halloween retailer
out of an empty storefront

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:34.870
on November 1st.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:37.140
Right as this happens, Eleven
and Hopper are in place

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:39.400
at the Hawkins lab, and
using all of her strength

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.120
and being overpowered and
stuff, Eleven closes the gate.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.490
Cutting off the Mind Flayer's
access to the Right Side Up.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.670
The Demogorgons aren't able
to survive without their host,

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.470
but Will, now free of the Mind Flayer,

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:49.840
is cool to see another day.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.920
But if we know anything

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.230
about the actual personality
of the Mind Flayer,

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.230
it's that this MF has
an appetite for revenge.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:57.870
First, it was the flame
through our mercenaries,

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.660
but now its sites would be set on Eleven

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.710
for cutting off its access
to the Right Side Up.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.860
And it has every intention
of making her pay

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:06.190
when the gate is reopened in 1985.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.870
In the arms race of the 1980s,
the Russians were competing

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.520
with the Americans in many things

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.930
which included going to space
and to developing weapons.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.010
That's the part that wasn't
recorded in the history books

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.890
was that this arms race also included

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:18.960
finding a way into this
newly discovered realm

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:20.570
that we know as the Upside Down.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.200
They too wanted to open the gates,

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.710
but instead of using a middle school-aged,

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:26.050
Carrie White wannabe or project MK Ultra,

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:28.250
they went about it in the
most Russian way possible

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.910
with a giant nuclear drill

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.830
which was hidden under
the new Starcourt Mall.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.510
In late June, the Russians
succeeded at opening the gate

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.960
advertently or inadvertently,

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.840
letting the Mind Flayer in once again,

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.020
this time with a new plan

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:40.850
and a desire to get back at Eleven.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.757
Instead of using Demogorgons,
Demowogs, Demofrogs,

00:09:43.757 --> 00:09:45.310
Demohogs, or Demodogs

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.470
for its demolition of
all things democratical,

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:49.180
it demonstrates its adaptability.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:51.560
Realizing that it would be
more effective to flay people

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.270
and develop an army of human bodies

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:55.210
as opposed to growing an army of its own.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.640
It uses the abandoned
Brimborn Steel Works warehouse

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.620
as its primary location and
decidedly more human accessible

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.220
safe house than the underground tunnels

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:04.620
which would make it easier
to lure in human victims.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.470
It begins making its come back
by infecting an army of rats

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.530
who congregate at the
Steel Works and explode

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:12.100
after eating the wrong combination
of hazardous materials.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.350
It's a whole thing.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:15.710
The sludge from their guts
and tissues comes together

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.040
and it takes on a physical
form of organic matter

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:20.570
which serves as the new physical
body for the Mind Flayer.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.870
Remember, every time we've seen
the Mind Flayer before this,

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.850
it's just made up of
these floating particles.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.390
So this is most likely the first time

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:27.880
that it has a physical form.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.470
The Mind Flayer is no longer picky

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:31.400
about who its first
human victim needs to be.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.180
Literally, just the
first person to drive by

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:34.090
will be just fine.

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:36.680
Unfortunately, for Billy
Hargrove his late night MILF call

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.513
ends up being more

00:10:37.513 --> 00:10:39.000
of a facial penetration event.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.400
As he's dragged into the Steel Works

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.660
by the malevolent creature.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.860
Billy ends up with the same
connection to the Mind Flayer

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.200
that we'll had a year prior.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.650
Being able to think its
thoughts and feel its feelings.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:49.210
It also communicates directly with him

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.020
by presenting a darker version of himself

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:51.950
that speaks to him.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:54.720
The Mind Flayer's impact on
Billy is immediately noticeable.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:57.150
When Billy is out in the
daytime, he's sweating profusely

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.350
and almost looks sick.

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.600
His skin even starts to burn

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:01.170
when exposed to the sun too much.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.780
When Karen Wheeler tries to apologize

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.250
for standing Billy up the night before

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.730
he sees a version of himself
smashing her into a wall,

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.280
probably as a result of the
Mind Flayer being active.

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:10.430
Instead of going through with this,

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:11.830
Billy overrides the Mind Flayer

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.610
and tells Karen to stay away from him,

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.640
probably for the better.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:16.430
As Billy tries to cool
off in a cold shower

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.230
and one of his killer life
guards, Heather Holloway,

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.063
checks in on him.

00:11:19.063 --> 00:11:20.130
She asks if he's okay,

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.348
but what Billy hears
is something different.

00:11:22.348 --> 00:11:23.910
HEATHER: Take me to him.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.710
- But this time Billy
is unable to go against

00:11:26.710 --> 00:11:28.514
the Mind Flayer's wishes.

00:11:28.514 --> 00:11:31.264
(dramatic music)

00:11:33.191 --> 00:11:35.774
(quirky music)

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:38.240
Heather next comes to

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.310
as she's being carried through
the Steel Works by Billy

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:41.890
who is under control of the Mind Flayer,

00:11:41.890 --> 00:11:42.940
he lays her down on the floor

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:45.520
in an almost ceremonious
way and whispers to her.

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:49.130
BILLY: Don't be afraid.
It'll be over soon.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:50.883
Just stay very still.

00:11:50.883 --> 00:11:51.920
(Heather screaming)
- She doesn't.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:54.550
As the Mind Flayer is... flaying?

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:57.270
...it notices Eleven using
her powers to spy on Billy

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.020
and is able to vanish from her sight.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:01.460
The Mind Flayer spreads the
new victims from host to host

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:02.730
similar to a virus.

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:05.640
This means that its spread is
not dependent on Billy alone.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:07.450
An older woman in town, Doris Driscoll,

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.140
notices that she has rats in her basement

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:10.590
and that they're acting very strange,

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:12.370
being aggressive and eating fertilizer.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.770
She believes them to be diseased,

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:16.050
but eventually just like the
rats at Brimborn Steel Works,

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:18.900
her rats explodes allowing
the Mind Flayer to materialize

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.733
and infect her.

00:12:19.733 --> 00:12:21.540
As Mrs. Driscoll was driven
towards the hospital,

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.040
she reaches out for the Steel Works

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.720
as the ambulance passes by it

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.210
indicating that she wants to join

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.620
the source of the Mind Flayer.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:29.090
We never see if the rats are responsible

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:31.420
for infecting anyone else,
but we do see flayed Billy

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:32.990
and flayed Heather sitting down to dinner

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:33.950
with Heather's parents

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.650
eventually knocking them out as well,

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.070
taking them to Brimborn Steel Works

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:39.420
and bestowing them at the same fate.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.253
(monster expectorates)

00:12:40.253 --> 00:12:41.086
"IN THE FACE!"

00:12:42.358 --> 00:12:43.549
"IN THE FAAACE!"

00:12:43.549 --> 00:12:45.950
Once again, the flayed
looks sweaty and awful.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.610
I mean rough day at the office, dude?

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:50.160
The Mind Flayer does its best
to keep its human hosts cool

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.400
to combat the summer heat.

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.627
It certainly doesn't help
when Billy is lured by Eleven

00:12:53.627 --> 00:12:55.860
and her friends into a sauna at the pool.

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:57.520
They lock him in and crank up the heat

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.310
in their effort to expel the Mind Flayer.

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:00.840
As Billy writhes around in pain,

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.650
the Mind Flayer's hive
mind is still active,

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.440
making Mrs. Driscoll have a similar,

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:07.648
but somewhat more hilarious
reaction over at the hospital.

00:13:07.648 --> 00:13:10.050
(Doris screaming)

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.730
So the Mind Flayer takes over Billy

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:13.450
making him smash his way through the door,

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:15.230
which kind of makes me
think that the Mind Flayer

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.960
somehow makes him even stronger.

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.330
Billy is a pretty strong dude

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.990
who spends his free time pumping iron,

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:22.290
but he literally bends
and destroys a metal pipe.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.770
I mean, that's pretty impressive,

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:26.036
but I guess we've seen stranger things.

00:13:26.036 --> 00:13:28.090
(crowd applauding)

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.430
Billy's escape causes Eleven

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:30.700
to have a throw down against him.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.300
And while she is able to save her friends

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.760
the battle leaves her collapsed
on the floor in tears.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:37.420
But as the Mind Flayer returns
to Brimborn Steel Works,

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.240
flayed Billy expresses to flayed Heather

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.343
that this fight was just as hard on him.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.679
HEATHER: The girl was it, her was her?

00:13:45.679 --> 00:13:48.060
BILLY: Yeah, it was her.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:51.370
She knows now, she knows about me.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.140
She could have killed me.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.793
HEATHER: Yes, but not us.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.220
Not us.

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:01.750
- Billy and Heather are more concerned

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.190
about the collective whole of
the Mind Flayer's influence

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.400
rather than their own
individual wellbeing.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.070
This sentiment is not that far off

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.880
from the ideas promoted by
Soviet Union propaganda.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.750
Red army posters advertised slogans

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:13.920
that perpetuated the idea

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.430
that everyone together is
better than the individual.

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.440
The idea is also reflected in the manner

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.050
in which the hive mind operates.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:21.550
The Mind Flayer can perceive the thoughts

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:23.840
and feelings of any of the
organisms that is flayed,

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.970
but Will, Billy and the other victims

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:28.420
aren't necessarily given
any information in return.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:30.810
Just like the KGB might
encourage Russian citizens

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.200
to report suspicions of
anticommunist behavior

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.820
while still keeping its main agenda,

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.070
a secret from the public.

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:37.170
In the case of the Mind Flayer,

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:39.180
it was building something
big in the shadows

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:40.860
as the 4th of July approached.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.470
In the meantime, more people start to see

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:43.810
the creature's physical form.

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:45.720
After Jonathan Byers and Nancy Wheeler

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:48.160
fight off the flayed Hawkins
Post newspaper employees,

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.610
they break down into sludge

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.290
just like the rats from the Steel Works,

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.390
and the material is added
to the monster's body.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.160
Nancy tries to escape and lock herself

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.430
in an empty room at the hospital,

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.130
but the Mind Flayer's
ability to turn itself

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.640
into a gelatinous elementary
school cafeteria food form

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.220
allows it to leak through the cracks,

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:04.610
but before she can be added
to the ranks of the flayed,

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:07.810
Eleven shows up in air
yeets that MF into the wall.

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.070
It's actually one of the best
air yeets I think we've seen.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.010
After then getting air
yeeted out the window,

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.430
I think the Mind Flayer realizes

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.640
that it's no match for Eleven
when she's at full strength

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.120
and retreats into a storm drain.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.560
Certainly not the first time
I've analyzed a creature

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:22.640
that utilizes a sewer system
to terrorize a small town.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:24.680
Presumably there are more unknown victims

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:25.600
that become flayed.

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:26.880
A news report at the end of states

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:29.260
that 30 people died in a
fire at the Starcourt Mall

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:30.890
which is probably a government coverup

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:32.170
for what really went on there.

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:33.910
I'm guessing these 30 people represent

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.570
all of the victims of the Mind Flayer.

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.800
They would include Doris, Billy, Heather,

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.230
Heather's mom and dad, and to
Bruce from the Hawkins Post

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.430
which means there are
probably 24 other victims

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:43.470
throughout Hawkins.

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.770
That also makes it clear
what the Mind Flayer means

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:48.150
when it repeatedly talks
about building something.

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:49.990
Like when Eleven infiltrates Billy's mind

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.420
try to find the source of the corruption

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.130
and accidentally pulls the Mind Flayer

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:55.230
or at least the flayed
portion of Billy's brain

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:56.854
into her own head space.

00:15:56.854 --> 00:16:00.770
BILLY: You let us in

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:04.707
and now you are going
to have to let us stay.

00:16:05.794 --> 00:16:09.803
Don't you see? All this
time we've building it,

00:16:11.491 --> 00:16:14.560
we've been building it for you.

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:15.540
- If this is the case,

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.800
it shows that the Mind
Flayer is kind of insane,

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:20.100
and this whole thing was
basically a revenge plot.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.400
Before this, I kind of assumed that

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.750
this was like a world domination
sort of thing, but no,

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.583
the Mind Flayer is still pissed

00:16:24.583 --> 00:16:26.324
about Eleven closing the gate.

00:16:26.324 --> 00:16:27.810
I guess the lesson to be learned here

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.830
is don't go after someone else's dogs.

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:30.820
That's not cool.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.500
MIKE: I have a feeling that
really pissed them off.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.470
- As Eleven escapes the
grasp of the Mind Flayer

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:35.890
within the world of her own mind,

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.950
it had already summoned
everyone that had been flayed

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.520
sending them to the Brimborn Steel Works

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.760
where they're broken down
into the dark sludge material

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:43.930
and absorbed into the
stature of the Mind Flayer.

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:45.410
Which explains how it was able to grow

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.690
from a roughly seven foot
tall monster at the hospital

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.670
to basically a 16 foot big
boy by Independence Day.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.540
And as with any good
Independence Day celebration,

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.390
there were about to be some fireworks.

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:59.496
MAYOR KLINE: Who here wants
to see some fireworks?

00:16:59.496 --> 00:17:01.234
(crowd cheers)

00:17:01.234 --> 00:17:03.817
(upbeat music)

00:17:05.979 --> 00:17:08.979
(suspenseful music)

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.900
While most of Hawkins was distracted

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.100
and enamored by the
colorful fireworks display

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:15.420
at the 4th of July carnival,

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:18.510
the Mind Flayer was busy making
more moves in the shadows.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.420
Having used Eleven's
own tactic against her

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.660
by stepping into her mind.

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:24.330
It now knew her location
and was hungry for a rematch

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.320
using its new, more powerful body.

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:28.010
Another big showdown occurs,

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.740
and although Eleven is
able to, once again,

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.150
get the upper hand by dismembering

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.430
two of the creatures orfices,

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:34.830
it nearly captures her after
dragging her by the ankle.

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.900
And she's only able to
escape, thanks to Nancy

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.185
who shoots the Mind Flayer.

00:17:38.185 --> 00:17:39.380
"In the face!"

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.730
- Eleven wards off the creature

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:43.350
by using what appears to be
the full force of her powers

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:46.280
to split his head into two even
if only temporarily, however

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.760
the bite on her leg leaves
her in tremendous pain.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:51.100
The kids escape to the mall
where Eleven passes out,

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.290
and it's revealed that a slug,

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:55.020
just like the one that will
coughed up on Christmas in 1983,

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.900
is moving around inside her leg.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.560
She's eventually able to
excruciatingly remove it,

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.620
but it seems that it may
have accomplished its mission

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.730
anyways, because after this
Eleven loses her powers.

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.070
At this point, we don't
know with 100% certainty

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:09.070
how this Demowog left behind in her leg.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:10.470
might've contributed to the hampering

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:12.800
of her telekinesis, but let's
look at what we do know.

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:14.780
Eleven's powers have never been unlimited.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.660
The more telekinetic,
heavy lifting she does,

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.680
the bigger the nosebleed
she gets as a result.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.380
So we can conclude that her powers

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:22.730
are somehow related to
her circulatory system.

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:24.730
When the will was infected,
he became very sick

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:27.360
and required many hospital
and lab visits to recover.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:29.620
Seeing as how the slug was
moving around inside of El,

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.820
I'm guessing that it was able
to infect her bloodstream

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:32.780
which may be the reason

00:18:32.780 --> 00:18:35.450
she's no longer able to
call upon her telekinesis.

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:36.950
Billy, locates the kids at the mall

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.840
and alerts the Mind
Flayer of their location.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.870
It shows up and crashes
through the glass ceiling

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:43.210
above the food court,
then using its long arms,

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:45.230
searches the mall,
probably looking for Eleven

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:46.640
or anyone else it can flay.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.490
Despite not being able to rely
on Eleven's powers this time,

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:51.540
the kids still managed
to almost outsmart it

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.940
by using a litany of sounds,

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.470
including the engine of Jonathan's car

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:57.360
to lure it's away from Eleven
and everyone else at the mall.

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.260
But this ruse only goes so far,

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:00.810
as Billy witnesses Max and Mike

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:02.190
trying to help Eleven out of the mall,

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:04.510
and sermons the Mind Flayer
back to her location.

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:05.710
Without her telekinesis,

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.940
Billy has a much easier
time defeating Eleven

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.440
and brings her back to the food court,

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:12.160
offering her to his master
in an almost ceremonious way

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:14.520
as we've seen him do to
others at the Steel Works.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.323
He even gives the same warning.

00:19:16.323 --> 00:19:18.347
BILLY: Don't be afraid.

00:19:18.347 --> 00:19:20.097
It will be over soon.

00:19:21.222 --> 00:19:23.555
Just try and stay very still

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.580
- But El's friends still
have one last trick

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:29.420
and it is an explosive one.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:31.450
As we know the Mind
Flayer doesn't like heat,

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.070
so the fireworks that Mike and Lucas

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:34.500
stole from a grocery store earlier

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.750
end up being an ideal
weapon to fight back with.

00:19:36.750 --> 00:19:38.210
They engage in a huge battle,

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.100
really dealing some major
hits on the Mind Flayer,

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:41.440
in order to protect Eleven.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.330
Now, throughout the video,

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.960
I've explained to many
of the different ways

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:44.793
that this monster

00:19:44.793 --> 00:19:47.210
represents the communist
ideals of the USSR.

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:48.900
So the fact that our American heroes

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:52.620
use 4th of July fireworks, a
literal image of USA patriotism

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.240
and democracy to fight the creature,

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:56.940
is the perfect symbol for
the '80s political subtext

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:58.360
that has been running over and under

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:00.510
the first three seasons
of "Stranger Things."

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.670
But ultimately these
efforts are only enough

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:04.210
to slow the Mind Flayer down.

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:05.620
The final blow, so to speak,

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.960
ironically comes from the
monster's greatest servant,

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:09.960
Billy Hargrove, who gets
a little bit of control

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.310
over his own body back
after Eleven enters his mind

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:13.750
and reminds him of his childhood.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.580
Billy takes a stand
against the Mind Flayer

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.580
and sacrifices himself
to protect his sister

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:19.330
and her friends long
enough for Joyce Byers

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:21.200
to get to the gates to the Upside Down.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:22.870
Like the Russian scientist, Alexi,

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.850
who was executed for
aiding his American friends

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:25.683
earlier that day,

00:20:25.683 --> 00:20:27.990
the mind Flayer no longer
has any use for Billy.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:30.120
And he becomes a victim
of its metaphorical,

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.210
capital punishment.

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:33.300
However, he would be its final victim.

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.310
As the closing of the gate

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.950
causes the creature to
immediately shut down and die.

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:38.170
But while this was the end

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.990
of the elementary school
cafeteria lunch meat

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:40.930
version of the MF,

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:43.220
we would see the original
shadow monster form

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.230
looking over rural America again.

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:46.063
That's right.

00:20:46.063 --> 00:20:48.319
I'm talking about Rocket League.

00:20:48.319 --> 00:20:51.632
(car engine revving)

00:20:51.632 --> 00:20:54.215
(upbeat music)

00:20:56.111 --> 00:20:58.950
In 2019 during a good old
classic game of League,

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:01.410
the farmstead was thrown
into a perpetual state

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:03.640
of Upside Down and the
Mind Flayer appeared

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.560
for the first time in many years.

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:06.920
It seems by now the Mind Flayer

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.500
has pretty much forgotten about Eleven

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.030
and just looms over the farmstead

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:12.270
and takes in some good
old games of soccer.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.730
Now, I know some of you
are going to try to say

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:16.050
that Rocket League isn't part
of "Stranger Things Canon,"

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:18.790
but really I imagine Rocket
League takes place so many years

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.180
after 1985, that it would
really be difficult to say

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:23.160
that Mike, Lucas, Will and Dustin

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.400
do not eventually turn into
these little egg characters.

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:27.260
I mean, look, you can see
Chief Hopper right there.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.580
So I don't really see anything
to suggest that Rocket League

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:30.590
is not canon here.

00:21:30.590 --> 00:21:32.220
Not sure about "Dead
By Daylight" though...

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:33.500
If you wanna see the histories

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.210
of more stranger things characters,

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:36.790
click that playlist on the left.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:37.623
And if you love horror,

00:21:37.623 --> 00:21:40.365
remember to subscribe to
CZsWorld for new horrors

00:21:40.365 --> 00:21:41.198
every week,

00:21:41.198 --> 00:21:43.110
ring the death bell for notifications

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:45.160
and I'll see you in the next one,

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.926
assuming we both survive.

00:21:47.926 --> 00:21:50.509
(upbeat music)

